  "prefLabel": "Gen 302.01 Types of Initial Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 302.01 Types of Initial Licensure. The OPLC shall issue one of the following 2 types of initial licenses to applicants who are eligible for them and who comply with the application procedures:\n\n(a) Full initial licenses as set forth in Gen 304; or\n\n(b) Provisional licenses as set forth in Gen 305.\n\nSource. #10686, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14337, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
